    },
    {
      "subId": "1905152",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "190515201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "190515201": {
            "id": "190515201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "真是有些期待你的表现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1905153",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "190515301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "190515301": {
            "id": "190515301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "银杏",
            "text": "一定要注意身体健康哦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1905154",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "190515401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "190515401": {
            "id": "190515401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "绘星",
            "text": "迟早我会把这些符号都破译出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1905155",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "190515501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "190515501": {
            "id": "190515501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "徐六石",
            "text": "以后要是想知道更多，还可以再来找我。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1905199",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "190519901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "190519901": {
            "id": "190519901",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "这里以前也是有名字的，叫作「下川」，因为人们最早是从一个叫「上川」的地方搬来的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519902"
            ]
          },
          "190519902": {
            "id": "190519902",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "还把世代相传的捕鱼技巧也一起带了过来，我在的时候，还学到了不少呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519903"
            ]
          },
          "190519903": {
            "id": "190519903",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "如今「上川」不再，「下川」也物是人非。连记得这名字的人，也越来越少了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519904"
            ]
          },
          "190519904": {
            "id": "190519904",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "我来这里大概一两年后的一个冬天，村长不幸染上了风寒，走了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519905"
            ]
          },
          "190519905": {
            "id": "190519905",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "偏偏那时候村里收成也在变差，捕到的鱼一天比一天少。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519906"
            ]
          },
          "190519906": {
            "id": "190519906",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "没有村长主持大局，人们开始互相埋怨，甚至造谣说别家把鱼苗都捕空了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519907"
            ]
          },
          "190519907": {
            "id": "190519907",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "直到最后，他们把矛头对准了我，说最开始就不该留下我，说我是不祥。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519908"
            ]
          },
          "190519908": {
            "id": "190519908",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "说我来这里第一天，就克死了那狗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519909"
            ]
          },
          "190519909": {
            "id": "190519909",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "之后还克死了村长，还克死了附近所有的鱼，",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519910"
            ]
          },
          "190519910": {
            "id": "190519910",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "说我是毁掉村子的灾星。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519911"
            ]
          },
          "190519911": {
            "id": "190519911",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "我不明白，我说我不是灾星，我是北斗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519912"
            ]
          },
          "190519912": {
            "id": "190519912",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "然后就有几个村民，大喊大叫着把我赶出了村子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519913"
            ]
          },
          "190519913": {
            "id": "190519913",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "他们喊：「南斗注生！北斗注死——北斗注死啊！」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519914"
            ]
          },
          "190519914": {
            "id": "190519914",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "那以前我只知道，自己的名字是天上的星星。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190519915"
            ]
          },
          "190519915": {
            "id": "190519915",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "北斗",
            "text": "那之后我才明白，这星星原来是代表死亡预兆的「死兆星」。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}